# LaTeX build artifacts — all of these are regenerated on every compile.
# Source files (*.tex, *.bib, *.cls, .latexmkrc, images/) are NOT ignored.

## Build output directory (all generated files + PDF now land here)
build/

## Official ESPRIT cover page PDF (binary, keep the source Word/PDF separately)
cover.pdf

## Core auxiliary files
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot

## latexmk
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

## minitoc (per-chapter mini tables of contents)
*.mtc
*.mtc[0-9]*
*.maf
*.ptc

## SyncTeX (PDF <-> source navigation cache)
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)

## Bibliography
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml

## Index / glossary / acronyms
*.idx
*.ind
*.ilg
*.glo
*.gls
*.acn
*.acr
*.alg

## Beamer / misc
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb

## minted (cached highlighted code — also requires -shell-escape)
_minted*/
*.pyg

## Compiled output — ignored by default since it is regenerated.
## If you WANT to commit the final PDF, delete the next line or add:  !main.pdf
*.pdf
